## 5. Space Agency Partner & Third-Party Resources (Herramientas y Recursos de Terceros)

- **Tech Stack:** Pure HTML5, CSS3, and Vanilla JavaScript (ES Modules) — zero external runtime frameworks or build dependencies.
- **Automated Balance Testing:** Node.js headless simulation bot (`tools/simulate.mjs`) running hundreds of automated mission runs to calibrate event timing, probabilities, and scoring curves.
- **Visual & Audio Implementation:**
  - **PICO-8 Color Palette** & custom 1/3-resolution pixelated HTML5 Canvas rendering (`PX = 3`) for the hangar and orbital map.
  - **Procedural SVG Animal Sprites** (`js/views/animals.js`) quantized into 40×40 PICO-8 sprites at startup.
  - **Web Audio API Chiptune Synthesizer** (`js/sfx.js`) generating all retro SFX procedurally without external audio assets.
  - **Bilingual Engine (`js/i18n.js` & `js/i18n-en.js`):** Live DOM/Canvas EN/ES translation shared across the main app and embedded STS-125 minigames.
- **Open-Source Assets & Licenses:**
  - *Press Start 2P* & *VT323* fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, bundled in `assets/fonts/`).
  - *Pixelarticons* by Gerrit Halfmann (MIT License, `assets/LICENSE-pixelarticons.txt`) + 6 custom space-themed pixel icons (`js/icons.js`).

